## 11. Decision Guidelines

**nullptr check?**
| Code | Check? |
|------|--------|
| `ptr->foo()` / `*ptr` | Yes (unless impossible by design) |
| Start of `func(T* p)` | Yes — early return |
| `T&` reference parameter | No (cannot be null) |

**bool or throw?**
| Situation | Prefer |
|-----------|--------|
| insert/get/push/pop/bounds | `bool` |
| Constructor cannot succeed | `throw` (or safe default, e.g. Date → 1/1/1) |
| Bad `operator[]` index | `throw` |

**Need `virtual ~Base()`?**
| Situation | Need? |
|-----------|-------|
| `delete` derived via `Base*` | Yes |
| Abstract / polymorphic base | Yes |
| No virtuals, no polymorphic delete | Not required |

